      },
      "_key": "!actors.items!NPup5xz3eYkB4Vhc.tvisN7BBtyqYfbYm"
    },
    {
      "name": "Foul Weather",
      "type": "feature",
      "system": {
        "featureForm": "reaction",
        "description": "<p>When the Open Water Countdown ticks down to an odd number, roll a <strong>d6</strong>. On a result of 4 or higher, the ship runs into a patch of foul weather, such as a fog bank that makes navigation difficult or a squall that threatens to capsize the ship. Each PC must succeed on a reaction roll using a relevant trait chosen by the GM or mark <strong>1d4</strong> Stress.</p><section id=\"secret-q3ZonXxWUaf350tb\" class=\"secret\"><p>What makes this weather different from anything the PCs have experienced before? How do they coordinate with the crew to find their way through this hazard?</p></section>",
        "attribution": {},
        "gmNotes": "",
        "resource": null,
        "actions": {},
        "originItemType": null,
        "multiclassOrigin": false
      },
      "_id": "A8979rx43bQwftNO",
      "img": "icons/magic/air/wind-weather-sailing-ship.webp",
      "effects": [],
      "folder": null,
      "sort": 0,
      "ownership": {
        "default": 0
      },
      "flags": {},
      "_stats": {
        "compendiumSource": null
      },
      "_key": "!actors.items!NPup5xz3eYkB4Vhc.A8979rx43bQwftNO"
    },
    {
      "name": "Here There Be Monsters",
      "type": "feature",
      "system": {
        "featureForm": "reaction",
        "description": "<p>When the Open Water Countdown ticks down to an even number, roll a <strong>d6</strong>. On a result of 4 or higher, summon <strong>1d4</strong> Deep Sea Denizens.</p><section id=\"secret-edpkLKKioU8ToEDv\" class=\"secret\"><p>What attracts these creatures to the ship? Is there any way to drive them off without combat?</p></section>",
        "attribution": {},
        "gmNotes": "",
        "resource": null,
        "actions": {},
        "originItemType": null,
        "multiclassOrigin": false
      },
      "_id": "7mrJfLzWik833uVN",
